entory","supportingHeadingsStatus","pending content migration","routeId","routePath","kind","source",{"_635":12,"_636":47,"_637":638,"_639":640,"_641":642,"_643":644},"metadata",{"_29":30,"_31":32,"_15":16,"_595":596,"_597":-5,"_598":599,"_600":601,"_602":603},"schema",[500,501],"headings",[480,481,482,483,484,485,486,487,488,489,490,491,492,493,494,495,496,497,498,499],"sections",[116,117,118,119,120,121,122,123,124],"links",[],"assets",[],"interactions",[],"flags",{"_54":28,"_55":56,"_113":114,"_69":115},"riskNotes","5 images lack width/height; quantified or absolute proof claims require substantiation",[],{"_125":448,"_127":449,"_129":-5,"_130":450,"_132":451,"_134":452},{"_125":412,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":413,"_132":414,"_134":415},{"_125":177,"_127":315,"_129":-5,"_130":373,"_132":374,"_134":375},{"_125":352,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":362,"_132":363,"_134":364},{"_125":244,"_127":315,"_129":-5,"_130":316,"_132":317,"_134":318},{"_125":271,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":272,"_132":273,"_134":274},{"_125":225,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":226,"_132":227,"_134":228},{"_125":183,"_127":184,"_129":-5,"_130":185,"_132":186,"_134":187},{"_125":126,"_127":128,"_129":-5,"_130":131,"_132":133,"_134":135},"order",9,"sourceSelector","section.section.brand-gradient.animate","sourceId","sourceClasses",[180,181,182],"heading",{"_176":177,"_146":178},"blocks",[136,137,138,139,140,141,142],{"_143":132,"_125":175,"_176":177,"_146":178,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":170,"_146":171,"_148":172,"_127":173},{"_143":144,"_125":166,"_146":167,"_148":168,"_127":156},{"_143":144,"_125":162,"_146":163,"_148":164,"_127":156},{"_143":144,"_125":158,"_146":159,"_148":160,"_127":156},{"_143":144,"_125":153,"_146":154,"_148":155,"_127":156},{"_143":144,"_125":145,"_146":147,"_148":149,"_127":150},"type","paragraph",56,"text","Book my free hospitality automation audit","segments",[151],"a.btn.btn-primary",{"_143":146,"_152":147},"value",55,"Read the guest concierge guide",[157],"a",{"_143":146,"_152":154},54,"Read the booking automation guide",[161],{"_143":146,"_152":159},53,"See hospitality pricing",[165],{"_143":146,"_152":163},52,"Browse all Silverstone AI services",[169],{"_143":146,"_152":167},51,"Unanswered enquiries and late no-shows leave tables and rooms unfilled. The ‘Hospitality 24/7 Guest Concierge’ shows how an always-on concierge layer can plug into your current systems.",[174],"p.section-subtitle",{"_143":146,"_152":171},50,"level",2,"Ready to stop losing bookings to busy shifts?","h2.section-title","section","brand-gradient","animate",8,"section.section.bg-lines.animate",[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":221},[188,189,190,191,192,193,194],{"_143":132,"_125":220,"_176":177,"_146":221,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":216,"_146":217,"_148":218,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":212,"_146":213,"_148":214,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":208,"_146":209,"_148":210,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":204,"_146":205,"_148":206,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":200,"_146":201,"_148":202,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":195,"_146":196,"_148":197,"_127":198},49,"Yes. We follow sensible data protection practices and only capture information that is genuinely needed for bookings and communication. You decide how long data is retained and which systems it is passed into.",[199],"p",{"_143":146,"_152":196},48,"You can quickly switch messaging to reflect closures, special menus or events. We can also pre-build seasonal or event-specific flows so that campaigns and set menus are supported without scrambling at the last minute.",[203],{"_143":146,"_152":201},47,"The goal is the opposite. Staff should see fewer repetitive questions and better quality enquiries. You will still choose how and when humans step in, but the system does the heavy lifting on confirmations, reminders and follow-ups.",[207],{"_143":146,"_152":205},46,"Yes. We can configure different flows, branding and information for each site while keeping a single view of how many enquiries and bookings are coming in. This is particularly useful for small groups that want consistent standards without losing local character.",[211],{"_143":146,"_152":209},45,"No. In most cases, we wrap around the booking tools you already use. The concierge can capture enquiries and either write into your existing system, send structured requests to your team or both. If you ever change platforms, the automation can move with you.",[215],{"_143":146,"_152":213},44,"The aim is for interactions to feel like messaging a switched-on member of your team. We use simple, conversational language and keep answers focused on what guests actually need. Whenever a query is unusual or sensitive, the system hands it back to a real staff member to respond.",[219],{"_143":146,"_152":217},43,"Hospitality Automation FAQs","bg-lines","parallax-section","compact-section",6,[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":270},[229,230,231,232,233,234,235,236,237,238],{"_143":132,"_125":269,"_176":177,"_146":270,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":265,"_146":266,"_148":267,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":263,"_176":244,"_146":264,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":259,"_146":260,"_148":261,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":257,"_176":244,"_146":258,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":253,"_146":254,"_148":255,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":251,"_176":244,"_146":252,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":247,"_146":248,"_148":249,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":243,"_176":244,"_146":245,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":239,"_146":240,"_148":241,"_127":198},42,"Data is handled in line with sensible data protection practices and kept within tools you are comfortable using.",[242],{"_143":146,"_152":240},41,4,"Data handled responsibly","h4",40,"You keep full control of what the system can and cannot do, with sensitive issues always routed straight to a human.",[250],{"_143":146,"_152":248},39,"Human handoff built in",38,"Messages are written in your tone of voice and can be different for casual bars, fine-dining restaurants or family hotels.",[256],{"_143":146,"_152":254},37,"Your tone of voice",36,"Fees are clear, with no long contracts or hidden extras.",[262],{"_143":146,"_152":260},35,"Transparent setup and monthly fees",34,"Automation should protect your guest experience — not compromise it.",[268],{"_143":146,"_152":266},33,"On-brand, guest-friendly, and privacy-aware",5,[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":314},[275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284],{"_143":132,"_125":313,"_176":177,"_146":314,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":309,"_146":310,"_148":311,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":307,"_176":244,"_146":308,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":303,"_146":304,"_148":305,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":301,"_176":244,"_146":302,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":297,"_146":298,"_148":299,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":295,"_176":244,"_146":296,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":291,"_146":292,"_148":293,"_127":198},{"_143":132,"_125":289,"_176":244,"_146":290,"_127":246},{"_143":144,"_125":285,"_146":286,"_148":287,"_127":198},32,"Adjust flows, add seasonal campaigns and refine messaging based on guest feedback and performance.",[288],{"_143":146,"_152":286},31,"Refine and expand",30,"Link the concierge into your phone, website and booking tools, then go live in a controlled way.",[294],{"_143":146,"_152":292},29,"Connect and launch",28,"Define how enquiries, bookings, reminders and reviews should flow for your specific venue.",[300],{"_143":146,"_152":298},27,"Design your guest journeys",26,"We map how guests currently contact you and where bottlenecks appear.",[306],{"_143":146,"_152":304},25,"Quick automation audit",24,"Four steps to get a 24/7 concierge live without disrupting service.",[312],{"_143":146,"_152":310},23,"Overlay your existing systems — don’t replace them","section.section.bg-circuit.animate",[180,361,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":360},[319,320,321,322,323],{"_143":132,"_125":359,"_176":177,"_146":360,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":355,"_146":356,"_148":357,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":351,"_176":352,"_146":353,"_127":354},{"_143":144,"_125":347,"_146":348,"_148":349,"_127":198},{"_143":324,"_125":325,"_326":327,"_328":329,"_127":330},"list",22,"ordered",false,"items",[331,332,333,334],"ul",{"_146":344,"_148":345},{"_146":341,"_148":342},{"_146":338,"_148":339},{"_146":335,"_148":336},"Managers see enquiry volume and booking patterns more clearly.",[337],{"_143":146,"_152":335},"Front-of-house staff stay with guests instead of tied to the phone.",[340],{"_143":146,"_152":338},"Lower no-show rates thanks to consistent reminders.",[343],{"_143":146,"_152":341},"Fewer missed calls and messages turn into lost bookings.",[346],{"_143":146,"_152":344},21,"Automation keeps enquiries moving while your team stays focused on guests.",[350],{"_143":146,"_152":348},20,3,"Less firefighting. More covers.","h3",19,"Capture more enquiries, reduce no-shows, and keep front-of-house focused on the room — not the phone.",[358],{"_143":146,"_152":356},18,"Fuller books, happier guests, calmer teams","bg-circuit",[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":372},[365,366],{"_143":132,"_125":371,"_176":177,"_146":372,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":367,"_146":368,"_148":369,"_127":173},17,"No-shows, slow replies and unanswered messages add up fast, even when the venue is busy.",[370],{"_143":146,"_152":368},16,"What missed bookings cost",[180,361,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":410},[376,377,378,379,380],{"_143":132,"_125":409,"_176":177,"_146":410,"_127":411},{"_143":144,"_125":405,"_146":406,"_148":407,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":403,"_176":352,"_146":404,"_127":354},{"_143":144,"_125":399,"_146":400,"_148":401,"_127":198},{"_143":324,"_125":381,"_326":327,"_328":382,"_127":330},15,[383,384,385,386],{"_146":396,"_148":397},{"_146":393,"_148":394},{"_146":390,"_148":391},{"_146":387,"_148":388},"Review invites and feedback routing after the visit.",[389],{"_143":146,"_152":387},"Automatic confirmations and reminders that cut no-shows.",[392],{"_143":146,"_152":390},"Booking capture from website and messaging into your existing systems.",[395],{"_143":146,"_152":393},"Multichannel answers for opening times, menus, allergens, and directions.",[398],{"_143":146,"_152":396},14,"This concierge layer answers common questions, captures bookings, and sends the confirmations guests need to show up.",[402],{"_143":146,"_152":400},13,"A digital front desk, 24/7",12,"An always-on concierge layer that captures enquiries, reduces no-shows, and helps you earn more reviews — without adding headcount.",[408],{"_143":146,"_152":406},11,"The ‘Hospitality 24/7 Guest Concierge’","h2#hospitality-guest-concierge",1,[180,222,182,223,224],{"_176":177,"_146":447},[416,417,418,419,420],{"_143":132,"_125":225,"_176":177,"_146":447,"_127":179},{"_143":144,"_125":443,"_146":444,"_148":445,"_127":173},{"_143":132,"_125":183,"_176":352,"_146":442,"_127":354},{"_143":144,"_125":126,"_146":439,"_148":440,"_127":198},{"_143":324,"_125":421,"_326":327,"_328":422,"_127":330},10,[423,424,425,426],{"_146":436,"_148":437},{"_146":433,"_148":434},{"_146":430,"_148":431},{"_146":427,"_148":428},"No-shows punch revenue gaps with little chance to resell the slot.",[429],{"_143":146,"_152":427},"Online enquiries and DMs sit unanswered when teams are stretched.",[432],{"_143":146,"_152":430},"Simple questions eat hours that should stay on the floor.",[435],{"_143":146,"_152":433},"Phones ring during service while staff are already with guests.",[438],{"_143":146,"_152":436},"When service is busy, unanswered calls, DMs, and late confirmations turn straight into empty tables and rooms.",[441],{"_143":146,"_152":439},"Where bookings get lost.",7,"When enquiries and DMs go unanswered, guests book elsewhere — and no-shows leave gaps you can’t fill.",[446],{"_143":146,"_152":444},"Busy shifts shouldn’t cost you bookings.",0,"section.hero.title-band",[478,479],{"_176":412,"_146":34},[453,454,455,456,457,458],{"_143":144,"_125":448,"_146":86,"_148":476,"_127":474},{"_143":144,"_125":412,"_146":84,"_148":473,"_127":474},{"_143":144,"_125":177,"_146":470,"_148":471,"_127":198},{"_143":144,"_125":352,"_146":466,"_148":467,"_127":468},{"_143":144,"_125":244,"_146":463,"_148":464,"_127":150},{"_143":144,"_125":271,"_146":459,"_148":460,"_127":461},"See the ‘Hospitality 24/7 Guest Concierge’ bundle",[462],"a.btn.btn-secondary",{"_143":146,"_152":459},"Book a free hospitality automation audit",[465],{"_143":146,"_152":463},"Typical fit: hotels, serviced stays, and small groups handling booking questions, late arrivals, and reviews.",[469],"p.hero-context",{"_143":146,"_152":466},"Automation that answers guest questions, takes bookings, and chases reviews while your team focuses on service.",[472],{"_143":146,"_152":470},[475],"a.hero-breadcrumb__link",{"_143":146,"_152":84},[477],{"_143":146,"_152":86},"hero","title-band",{"_125":448,"_176":412,"_146":34},{"_125":412,"_176":177,"_146":447},{"_125":177,"_176":352,"_146":442},{"_125":352,"_176":177,"_146":410},{"_125":244,"_176":352,"_146":404},{"_125":271,"_176":177,"_146":372},{"_125":225,"_176":177,"_146":360},{"_125":443,"_176":352,"_146":353},{"_125":183,"_176":177,"_146":314},{"_125":126,"_176":244,"_146":308},{"_125":421,"_176":244,"_146":302},{"_125":409,"_176":244,"_146":296},{"_125":405,"_176":244,"_146":290},{"_125":403,"_176":177,"_146":270},{"_125":399,"_176":244,"_146":264},{"_125":381,"_176":244,"_146":258},{"_125":371,"_176":244,"_146":252},{"_125":367,"_176":244,"_146":245},{"_125":359,"_176":177,"_146":221},{"_125":355,"_176":177,"_146":178},{"_125":448,"_502":535,"_504":536,"_506":537},{"_125":412,"_502":503,"_504":505,"_506":507},"types",[511,520,524],"rawJson","{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n    \"mainEntity\": [\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Will guests notice they are not talking to a person?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"The aim is for interactions to feel like messaging a switched-on member of your team. We use simple, conversational language and keep answers focused on what guests actually need. Whenever a query is unusual or sensitive, the system hands it back to a real staff member to respond.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Do we need to change our booking system?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"No. In most cases, we wrap around the booking tools you already use. The concierge can capture enquiries and either write into your existing system, send structured requests to your team or both. If you ever change platforms, the automation can move with you.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Can this handle multiple sites or brands?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes. We can configure different flows, branding and information for each site while keeping a single view of how many enquiries and bookings are coming in. This is particularly useful for small groups that want consistent standards without losing local character.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Will this add more work for my staff?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"The goal is the opposite. Staff should see fewer repetitive questions and better quality enquiries. You will still choose how and when humans step in, but the system does the heavy lifting on confirmations, reminders and follow-ups.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"What happens if we close for refurbishment or run special events?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"You can quickly switch messaging to reflect closures, special menus or events. We can also pre-build seasonal or event-specific flows so that campaigns and set menus are supported without scrambling at the last minute.\"\n        }\n      },\n      {\n        \"@type\": \"Question\",\n        \"name\": \"Is guest data handled safely?\",\n        \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n          \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n          \"text\": \"Yes. We follow sensible data protection practices and only capture information that is genuinely needed for bookings and communication. You decide how long data is retained and which systems it is passed into.\"\n        }\n      }\n    ]\n  }","parsed",{"_508":509,"_510":511,"_512":513},"@context","https://schema.org","@type","FAQPage","mainEntity",[514,515,516,517,518,519],{"_510":520,"_82":533,"_522":534},{"_510":520,"_82":531,"_522":532},{"_510":520,"_82":529,"_522":530},{"_510":520,"_82":527,"_522":528},{"_510":520,"_82":525,"_522":526},{"_510":520,"_82":521,"_522":523},"Question","Is guest data handled safely?","acceptedAnswer",{"_510":524,"_146":196},"Answer","What happens if we close for refurbishment or run special events?",{"_510":524,"_146":201},"Will this add more work for my staff?",{"_510":524,"_146":205},"Can this handle multiple sites or brands?",{"_510":524,"_146":209},"Do we need to change our booking system?",{"_510":524,"_146":213},"Will guests notice they are not talking to a person?",{"_510":524,"_146":217},[585,77,580,577,574,78,550],"{\n      \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n      \"@graph\": [\n        {\n          \"@type\": \"WebPage\",\n          \"@id\": \"https://silverstone-ai.com/services/hospitality#webpage\",\n          \"url\": \"https://silverstone-ai.com/services/hospitality\",\n          \"name\": \"Hospitality Automation for UK Teams - Silverstone AI\",\n          \"description\": \"Silverstone AI automation for UK hospitality teams: 24/7 guest enquiry handling, faster booking capture, fewer no-shows, and smoother operations.\",\n          \"isPartOf\": {\n            \"@id\": \"https://sil